msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances {#use-ibm-cloud-platform-"
"apis-to-access-instances}"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser les API de la plateforme IBM Cloud pour accéder aux instances "
"{#use-ibm-cloud-platform-apis-to-access-instances}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for anyone using the IBM Cloud Platform APIs to provision, "
"update, or manage access to instances. It provides details on the "
"[parameters](#parameters) you can set when provisioning an instance, as well"
" as the set of [extension fields](#extensions) returned when you access an "
"instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ce guide s'adresse à toute personne utilisant les API de la plateforme IBM "
"Cloud pour provisionner, mettre à jour ou gérer l'accès aux instances. Il "
"fournit des détails sur les [paramètres](#parameters) que tu peux définir "
"lors du provisionnement d'une instance, ainsi que sur l'ensemble des [champs"
" d'extension](#extensions) renvoyés lorsque tu accèdes à une instance.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Refer to the IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Consulte la documentation de l'API ResourceController d'IBM Cloud&reg; pour plus d'informations.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some relevant pages:\n"
"- [Create (provision) a new resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Update a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a list of all resource instances](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)  \n"
msgstr ""
"Quelques pages utiles :\n"
"- [Créer (provisionner) une nouvelle instance de ressource](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Mettre à jour une instance de ressource](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Obtenir une instance de ressource](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Obtenir la liste de toutes les instances de ressources](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When getting a list of all resource instances, note that you can filter to "
"only Qiskit Runtime instances with `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"
msgstr ""
"Lors de la récupération de la liste de toutes les instances de ressources, "
"note que tu peux filtrer la liste pour n'obtenir que les instances Qiskit "
"Runtime, avec `resource_id = \"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`parameters` {#parameters}"
msgstr "`parameters` {#parameters}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In the body when provisioning or updating an instance:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dans le corps lors du provisionnement ou de la mise à jour d'une instance "
":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): The limit to set on the instance. For Open Plan: if omitted, this defaults to 10 minutes.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): Allotted time for the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in the queue, based on usage of all QPUs. (This does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.)\n"
"- **backends** (array of lists of backends (strings or null) or array with \"ANY\"): the allow-list of names of backends that are available to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends available on this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`extensions` {#extensions}"
msgstr "`extensions` {#extensions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the response when provisioning or when getting the details of an "
"instance:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dans la réponse lors du provisionnement ou lors de la récupération des "
"détails d'une instance :\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional instance properties contributed by the service that are "
"represented as key-value pairs. These properties persist with the instance "
"under the extensions property.\n"
msgstr ""
"Propriétés d'instance supplémentaires apportées par le service, représentées"
" sous forme de paires clé-valeur. Ces propriétés persistent avec l'instance "
"sous la propriété extensions.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): The time limit to set "
"on the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (entier ou null, `>= 0`) : La limite de temps à "
"définir sur l'instance.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): Allotted time for "
"the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in "
"the queue, based on usage of all QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (entier ou null, `>= 0`) : Temps alloué à "
"l'instance, utilisé par l'ordonnanceur à partage équitable (fair-share) pour"
" déterminer la priorité dans la file d'attente, en fonction de l'utilisation"
" de tous les QPU.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**backends** (Required; array of lists of backends (strings) or array with "
"\"ANY\" (strings)): The allow-list of names of backends that are available "
"to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends are available on "
"this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"**backends** (Obligatoire ; tableau de listes de backends (chaînes) ou "
"tableau avec \"ANY\" (chaînes)) : La liste d'autorisation des noms de "
"backends disponibles pour cette instance. Par défaut : `[\"ANY\"]`, ce qui "
"signifie que tous les backends sont disponibles sur ce plan. `[]` signifie "
"aucun backend.\n"
